#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:633
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each message uses a compact metadata column — the author's nick (or the origin, like System or Error) above a smaller timestamp — beside the message text, which gets the wider column. This reads well on phones while keeping the retro monospace look."
